Subject: [PATCH 25/69] feat: portable identity export/import between River UI
 and riverctl (#137)

feat: portable identity export/import between River UI and riverctl

Adds a portable identity format (CBOR + base58 + PEM-like armor) that allows
users to export their room identity from the UI and import it in riverctl,
or vice versa. Includes signature validation, security warnings, and delegate
migration entry.

[AI-assisted - Claude]
